							<span class="contact-status-tag">AVAILABLE FOR CONSULTING</span>
						</div>
						<h2 id="contact-title" class="contact-title">
							<span class="contact-title-en">Let's Connect</span><span class="contact-title-separator" aria-hidden="true"> · </span><span class="contact-title-fr">Au Plaisir</span>
						</h2>
						<p class="contact-text">
							Available for systems consulting, mobile data layer architecture, and agentic swarms.<br class="hide-on-mobile" />
							If you value deterministic correctness under real-world device constraints, let's talk.
						</p>
						<div class="contact-buttons">
							<a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`} class="btn-apaper btn-apaper-primary">Direct Email ✉</a>
							<a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-apaper btn-apaper-ghost">GitHub ↗</a>
							<a href={WTCRAFT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-apaper btn-apaper-ghost">wtcraft ↗</a>
							<a href={LINKEDIN_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-apaper btn-apaper-ghost">LinkedIn ↗</a>
							<a href={MEDIUM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-apaper btn-apaper-ghost">Medium ↗</a>
						</div>
						<div class="contact-colophon-sub">
							<span>LOCATION: VANCOUVER, BC (PACIFIC TIME)</span>
							<span>HANDSHAKE PROTOCOL: DIRECT HUMAN INBOX</span>
