<style>
	/* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
	   APAPER "KAMI" EDITORIAL PUBLICATION SYSTEM & COLOR CUSTOMIZATION
	   Paper tones, carbon ink, hairline rules, and cinnabar seal.
